! SECTION 9B-2 - driver: re-extract S2 (8A LC2NS static) and, as validation, S1 (8A LC2 re-solve). Nothing is solved.
! Run 2: /CLEAR between the two files so that each result file is read with its own geometry and nodal rotations
! (Run 1 read both in one database; see Run1_shared_session/README.md).
/batch
*set,rstname,'s2'
*set,tag,'s2x'
/input,s2_reextract,inp
/clear,nostart
*set,rstname,'s1'
*set,tag,'s1x'
/input,s2_reextract,inp
/exit,nosave
